<title>USA: Echlin Inc president resigns.</title>
<headline>Echlin Inc president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BRANFORD, Conn. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Echlin Corp said on Friday its president, C. Scott Greer, resigned to pursue other business interests and that Chairman Frederick Mancheski would assume the duties until a successor was named.</p>
<p>The company also said it remained committed to achieving its earnings per share growth target of 15 percent.</p>
<p>Echlin makes motor vehicle parts.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
